{"t":1793438027618,"dir":"prompt","text":"Compare a message with the reply to it. List each concrete thing the message asks for that the reply neither handles, starts, plans nor talks about. Ignore musings and anything the reply asked back about.\nAnswer with exactly NONE, or one line per missed thing starting \"- \", quoting the message's own words.\n\n<message>\nContinue from where you left off.\n</message>\n\n<reply>\nThe hub preview was still building when I last checked. I'll see whether that report is in, and leave the shortcut question open until you pick a key.\n\nThe hub fixes are still being built in a preview and are not in the app yet.\n\nNeeds the user: which shortcut for a new chat?\nMy pick: ⌘N.\n</reply>"}
